# DECISIONS.log — append-only ADRs

## ADR-0001 … ADR-0013
See earlier entries: PixiJS renderer, fixed 60Hz sim, JSON content, door mats,
gesture-gated audio, pure engine modules, renderer-owned ambience, A* grid
pathfinding, seekers sharing the pathfinder, pure mini-game cores, top-down
interiors, validated story data, single overlay pause flag.

## ADR-0014: Runtime-caching service worker + SVG icon — 2026-08-08
Context: PWA needed offline support, but Vite emits hashed bundle names and
we ship zero binary assets. Decision: the service worker caches core files on
install and every successful GET at runtime; the icon is a single SVG
(maskable), so no PNG pipeline is required.
Consequences: fully offline after first load; no asset build step; install
prompt works on Android/desktop.
